        "created_at": "2026-02-12T22:25:17.445Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I accidently by entering rm file* deleted all the files which also included README.md file. I tried to login again to terminal but I am not getting the content of README.md. It is constantly showing me the below error. Please help to resolve this issue. I want to get all the deleted files. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/21f3000759\">@21f3000759</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/hemalatha\">@hemalatha</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mrinal.exe\">@Mrinal.exe</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/afnan_pod\">@Afnan_POD</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/22f3000671\">@22f3000671</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/f/3/f38d8039265b18e6034df066dcf5ac8ae0e70280.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yKzbKAw6mgSNLVX49CcVNYHKjny\" width=\"690\" height=\"41\" data-dominant-color=\"1F211D\"></p>",
