      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/sarthakjalota/{size}/142961_2.png",
      "created_at": "2026-02-13T01:06:29.003Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Looks like the README.md present in <code>$HOME</code> is a symbolic link to <code>/opt/se2001/README.md</code><br>\n<img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/6/1/61d69f28bf1f1658ebc5575f9da4ab3249d22c43_2_690x32.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dXw8EnSZFIrlBFmW3rWvdtNRAd5\" width=\"690\" height=\"32\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/6/1/61d69f28bf1f1658ebc5575f9da4ab3249d22c43_2_690x32.png, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/6/1/61d69f28bf1f1658ebc5575f9da4ab3249d22c43_2_1035x48.png 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/6/1/61d69f28bf1f1658ebc5575f9da4ab3249d22c43.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"081A0B\"></p>\n<p>You can check the original file</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"bash\"><code class=\"lang-bash\">batcat /opt/se2001/README.md\n</code></pre>\n<p>Then, you can restore the symlink with this</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"bash\"><code class=\"lang-bash\">ln -s /opt/se2001/README.md ~/README.md\n</code></pre>\n<p>As noted in the README FAQs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>I don’t have the directory <code>se2001</code> in my home directory. What should I do?</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create the directory with <code>mkdir ~/se2001</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I accidentally deleted my entire home directory including my <code>.bashrc</code> and now my prompt is changed. What should I do?</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Copy the <code>.bashrc</code>, <code>.profile</code>, and <code>.bash_logout</code> files from <code>/etc/skel/</code> to your home directory.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
